  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HAI: UNIFEM Female Partic</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HAI: UNIFEM Kvinnl deltag</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNIFEM programme in Haiti has the objective to support the dialogue between the women organisations, the government, the UN System and the donor community, with the purpose of strengthening women&apos;s influence, solidarity, knowledge, network and adcocacy work. The idea is to provide technical assistance on how gender aspects could be integrated in the national planning process.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNIFEMs program i Haiti har som m&#xe5;l att underl&#xe4;tta dialogen mellan kvinnoorganisationerna, regeringen, FN-systemet och givarsamfundet, med syfte att st&#xe4;rka kvinnors inflytande, solidaritet, kunskaper, n&#xe4;tver och p&#xe5;verkansarbete. Avsikten &#xe4;r att tillhandah&#xe5;lla teknisk r&#xe5;dgivning om hur genderaspekter kan integreras i landets planeringsprocess.</narrative>
  </description>
